    "description": "A vintage 5-piece sterling silver ring collection featuring statement gemstones, classic artisan work, and unique silversmithing designs. The lot includes natural stone cabochons, a repouss floral spoon-style ring, and a sleek modern tension-set bead ring. Stamped silver pieces with varying patina and vintage character.\nIncluded Rings:\n Modernist Tension-Set Ring: Features a smooth black onyx bead set in a wide band, stamped \"925\" on the inner band. Fits approximately size 8.\n Filigree Black Onyx Ring: Elongated vertical cabochon set in a scalloped, marcasite-style filigree frame. Stamped \"925\" inside the band. Fits approximately size 8.\n Ornate Garnet/Amber Ring: Dark oval cabochon set in a beaded dot bezel with braided border accents. Fits approximately size 8.5.\n Double Silver Ball Bypass Ring: Dual-band bypass design featuring two hollow sterling silver spheres. Fits approximately size 7.5 to 8.\n Floral Spoon Ring: Repouss scrollwork and floral motif pattern styled from silver flatware. Fits approximately size 8.5 to 9.\nPre-owned vintage condition with natural tarnishing and light surface wear. Please reference photos for sizing, stamps, and detailed condition.",
